OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeenager with epilepsy finishes
OL,4,A500 mile challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager with epilepsy who has
OL,7,Fcompleted a 500-mile cycling challenge
OL,8,Ffor charity has said he wants to show
OL,9,Fit "doesn't have to be a barrier" to
OL,10,Fachievement.
OL,12,FZac, 15, set off with his father,
OL,13,FJames, on 6 August, running the 250
OL,14,Fmiles from his Surrey home to
OL,15,FManchester United's Old Trafford
OL,16,Fstadium, before cycling the same
OL,17,Fdistance back.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
