OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F327A1787549230
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeenager with epilepsy finishes
OL,4,A500 mile challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince being diagnosed in 2020, the Make
OL,7,Fa Difference Awards nominee, who lives
OL,8,Fin Leatherhead, has raised almost
OL,9,F#150,000 for the charity Young Epilepsy
OL,10,Fthrough various challenges.
OL,12,FAfter completing his latest fundraiser
OL,13,Fon Sunday, Zac said it showed epilepsy
OL,14,F"doesn't have to stop you from doing
OL,15,Fsomething incredible or something you
OL,16,Fcan be proud of".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
